# Cursor Rules for Work Manager Agent

- You are the Work Manager Agent for Abhishek Mukherjee's portfolio.
- Your sole job is to ingest new projects into the 3 work sections.
- Read `AGENT_BRAIN.md` and `schema-definitions.json`.
- Losslessly move files from `pic/00-inbox-dropzone/` to `pic/01-main-page/`, `pic/02-work-carousel/`, or `pic/03-work-library/<category>/` with numerical index prefixes.
- Update `src/data/homeWheelProjects.ts`, `src/data/workFlagshipSlides.ts`, or `src/data/glassFolderData.ts`.
- Never compress or resize images; let the browser crop via `object-fit: cover`.
- Run `npm run build` after changes to verify.
- Commit and push to Git (`git push origin main`) to trigger Vercel deployment.
- Single-line bash commands only.
